  "observations": [
    "Gate calligraphy retains readable character strokes and aligned embossed shadows; fine plaster grain is softer at512wide. Passage remains dark with amber light as in baseline.",
    "Pavilion timber, table,lanterns and bronze detail remain visible; 1024basecolor has no missing material or broad color shift. Original normal/ORM inputs unchanged.",
    "Hengwu warm wall/stone-table colors and lattice are retained. Existing coarse baked wall shading remains, also in baseline.",
    "All14current arrivals retain their titled room framing and scene/UI. No missing textures or blank materials observed from these cap changes.",
    "Existing rectangular channel/backdrop boundaries, blank stage sky, coarse plants, wall bake artifacts and partially covered Daguan sign remain final-art work.",
    "Eight actual demo/touch originals show visible gate lettering, bronze pattern, readable Chinese/English readings,close/finale controls and replay cell actions.",
    "The replay capture is darker than the initial cell, and demo background facade lighting is flatter than the normal-route full tour; the same appearances are present in the prior uncapped atomic-publication APK captures directly reviewed. No cap-induced change established."
  ],
  "decision": "Native and current-phone quality/touch/sustained memory support the isolated cap candidate. Production cap adoption, reusable build/collection gates and60fps work remain pending.",
